      "content": "Here's a draft of Alex's performance review:\n\n\"Alex, I wanted to take a moment to discuss your recent performance as we approach the end of the quarter. While you've made significant contributions to the team in the past, there have been some areas of concern that need attention. Specifically, your consistency and timing around deadlines have been an issue, with three major releases missing their target dates last month. To improve, I'd like to see you prioritize tasks, manage your time more effectively, and provide more specific updates during standups to ensure the team is aligned. Additionally, I encourage you to re-engage with the team in meetings and come prepared with well-thought-out ideas to share. By tackling these areas, I'm confident you can regain your momentum and continue to make meaningful contributions to our project.\"\n\nThis review addresses the specific issues you mentioned, while still providing constructive feedback that can help Alex grow as an engineer.",
